flowchart TD
    User["User Browser"] --> UI["UI (Svelte SPA)"]
    UI -->|HTTP APIs| APIGW["Django API Gateway"]
    UI -->|WebSocket channels| WSGW["Django Channels"]
    APIGW --> APPCORE["BE/application"]
